    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Dog owners love to take pictures with their furry friends. After all, it’s a great way to keep "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "precious",
            "ref": "v-precious"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " moments with their pets. But in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Argentina",
            "zh": "阿根廷"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", one dog named Preguntale seems to have taken things to a new "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He has seemingly taken his owner, Diego Cuadro, out of the picture to take his own "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "selfies",
            "zh": "自拍照"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Preguntale entered Cuadro’s life in 2016. While riding his horse on his farm, the man "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a small dog. "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Feral dogs",
            "zh": "野狗"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " weren’t uncommon in the area, but this puppy was different. He was following Cuadro and seemed to be crying."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Without hesitation, Cuadro "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the puppy. He wasn’t planning on getting a dog, so he didn’t even think of a name for the animal. Preguntale is not a(n) "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " name for a pet. But one day, a friend asked Cuadro what he called the dog, and he said, “"
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "No lo sé, pregúntale"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " (I don’t know, ask him).” In Spanish, Preguntale actually means “ask him”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "As time passed, a loving "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " developed between Cuadro and Preguntale. One day, the man discovered his dog’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " talent while trying to balance a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "kernel",
            "zh": "麦粒"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on his nose. Cuadro told him to stand "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "still",
            "ref": "v-still"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and Preguntale "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "effortlessly",
            "ref": "v-effortlessly"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Preguntale’s talent for "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "posing",
            "zh": "摆姿势"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " allowed him to take selfies “on his own”. The dog also appeared to be able to ride horses and bicycles. When Cuadro shared these "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " moments on social media, Preguntale became an internet star almost overnight. “One man even cried upon seeing Preguntale at an agricultural event,” Cuadro said. “He was grateful for the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Preguntale’s pictures had brought him.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "But beyond the laughter, these funny pictures offer a window into the love between a man and his dog. “For me, Preguntale is "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ",” Cuadro said. “Wherever I am, he’s right there by my side.”"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
